12-31T12:39:26.000Z\">2025-12-31</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\" style=\"--text-p2:#FFDD88;--theme-block:#FFDD8820\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>楠竹蓮花集</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/585cfa20/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">†[BUAA 基礎物理學]基础物理学 B II 概要</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北航基础物理学 B (II) 概要。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-21T08:09:13.000Z\">2025-12-21</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 基礎物理學</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/52a88c87/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO]CO 理论概要</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北航计算机组成理论概要。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-16T12:50:27.000Z\">2025-12-16</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"